## Why This Is Asked

Provenance and traceability are essential in real-world data pipelines; this tests ability to design end-to-end lineage with minimal components.

## Key Concepts

- Data provenance tagging
- DynamoDB as a lineage store
- Parquet with metadata for downstream queries
- DLQ handling and observability basics
- LocalStack test planning for end-to-end validation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-Lambda handler sketch to attach provenance
function handler(event){ 
  const provenance = { eventId: event.id, deviceId: event.device, firmwareVersion: event.fw, ingestionTs: Date.now(), pipelineId: 'proc-1' };
  event.provenance = provenance;
  return event;
}
```

